# === Secrets & Environment ===
# Most env files are ignored by default. Specific files listed under the
# git-crypt exceptions below ARE tracked, but only as ciphertext via git-crypt.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
firebase-service-account.json
google_credentials.json
**/google_credentials.json
CLIProxyAPI*/

# --- git-crypt encrypted exceptions ---
# On a fresh clone: install git-crypt, then `git-crypt unlock <keyfile>`
!Nymeria/.env.docker
!Nymeria/.env
!Nymeria/firebase-service-account.json
!Nymeria/google_credentials.json

# === Databases & User Data ===
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
Nymeria/data/

